---
kind: lore
id: north.earthGymTrainers
title: The Earth Gym — Team Eclipse's last floor
---

// North's part of the Eclipse arc: the Earth Gym is Director Vex's gym, and
// its trainers are his grunts, with Admin Selene guarding the office door.
// Once Vex is beaten (defeated(vex)) the grunts have left: an unbeaten one
// no longer battles. Selene's battle has two phases, each a direct
// ::battle{resultKey="fight"} (AREAS.md §5).

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="earthGymGruntHask" when="!holds('defeated', ['vex'])" who="earthGymGruntHask" intro="Nobody gets seven badges by accident. So you're the one who wrecked the dig. I've wanted to meet you!" win="Okay. Meeting you was a mistake." lose="That's for the dig!" prize="2400"/>

<entry id="northHaskAfter" on="talk" target="npc.earthGymGruntHask" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['earthGymGruntHask'])">
  @earthGymGruntHask: I was on the dig under Moonstone Cave, you know. We were so close to the good fossils.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="earthGymGruntMoll" when="!holds('defeated', ['vex'])" who="earthGymGruntMoll" intro="This is a real gym, you know. The Director makes us do gym trainer duty on Tuesdays. Today's Tuesday somewhere!" win="Gym trainer duty is the worst duty." lose="Gym trainer duty rules!" prize="2400"/>

<entry id="northMollAfter" on="talk" target="npc.earthGymGruntMoll" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['earthGymGruntMoll'])">
  @earthGymGruntMoll: The Director built this gym with Eclipse money. The League never asked where it came from.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="earthGymGruntTeague" when="!holds('defeated', ['vex'])" who="earthGymGruntTeague" intro="Helix Tower, Ash Tower, the Game Corner... and you still came here? You really don't know when to stop!" win="Neither do I, apparently." lose="Stop now! Stop!" prize="2400"/>

<entry id="northTeagueAfter" on="talk" target="npc.earthGymGruntTeague" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['earthGymGruntTeague'])">
  @earthGymGruntTeague: If you beat the Director I'm going back to Wardenmere. My mum has a bakery. She never liked the uniform.
</entry>

<entry id="northGruntsGone" on="talk" target="npc.earthGymGruntTeague" category="bark" priority="5" when="holds('defeated', ['vex'])">
  @earthGymGruntTeague: The Director's gone? Then so am I. Wardenmere. The bakery. Don't follow me.
</entry>

// ── Admin Selene: two phases ────────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat id="earthGymAdminSelene" on="trainerSpotted" target="trainer.earthGymAdminSelene" title="Admin Selene" once="false" when="!holds('defeated', ['earthGymAdminSelene']) && !holds('defeated', ['vex'])">
  ::auto{character="earthGymAdminSelene" anchor="center" action="enter"}
  @earthGymAdminSelene{emotion="smug"}: Admin Selene, Team Eclipse. I run the Director's calendar, and you are not on it.
  ::music{action="change" mood="battle" volume="up"}
  ::battle{foe="earthGymAdminSelene" kind="boss" team="first" resultKey="fight"}
  <match on="scene.battle.fight.won">
    <when is="true">
      @earthGymAdminSelene{emotion="angry"}: You think that was my team? That was my warm-up. Rhinotitan! Out!
      ::battle{foe="earthGymAdminSelene" kind="boss" team="second" resultKey="fight"}
      <match on="scene.battle.fight.won">
        <when is="true">
          @earthGymAdminSelene: ...Fine. The door is yours. He is expecting you. He has been expecting you since Moonstone Cave.
          ::assert{defeated(earthGymAdminSelene)}
          ::set{run.money += 3600}
          @narrator: {{userName}} got 3600 coins for winning!
        </when>
        <otherwise>
          @earthGymAdminSelene{emotion="smug"}: Two teams. You were ready for one. Come back when you can count.
        </otherwise>
      </match>
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @earthGymAdminSelene{emotion="smug"}: Not even the warm-up. The Director will be disappointed. In you, I mean.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</beat>

<entry id="northSeleneAfter" on="talk" target="npc.earthGymAdminSelene" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['earthGymAdminSelene']) && !holds('defeated', ['vex'])">
  @earthGymAdminSelene: Go on, then. His door is the one without a handle.
</entry>

<entry id="northSeleneGone" on="talk" target="npc.earthGymAdminSelene" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['vex'])">
  @earthGymAdminSelene: He left without a word. Twelve years I kept his calendar. I think I'll take a holiday.
</entry>
